Error [jet.BuildAuthorityDenied]: Build action `stamp` needs `Exec`, which this build does not grant
 Why: Build authority must pass all three independent checks before any probe or action executes.
 Fix: Grant it with `--allow=Exec` or in package or workspace policy; `build: fn` declares the effect and makes the call inside `#Impure("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3503
